T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Structure, Mechanism, and Regulation of Violaxanthin De-Epoxidase \(VDE\):) Tj
T*
(   1. Physiological Role and Subcellular Localization:) Tj
T*
(   Violaxanthin de-epoxidase \(VDE\) is a 43 kDa water-soluble, lumen-localized enzyme that) Tj
T*
(   catalyzes the two-step sequential de-epoxidation of the diepoxide xanthophyll Violaxanthin to) Tj
T*
